description=A simple mod to remove the "isRunning" check from Search Mode's "checkShouldDisable" function-- allowing you to run while foraging while maintaining the vanilla debuff to search effectiveness.

Search Mode can still be disabled manually, by sprinting, or from proximity to zeds.
